%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-binaries-functions-writelineswith (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
    "lines": "Line 1\nLine 2\nLine 3\nLine 4\nLine 5\n"
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Binaries
output application/json
---
{ lines: to(1, 10) map "Line $" writeLinesWith  "UTF-8" }
%%% output application/json
{
  "lines": "Line 1\nLine 2\nLine 3\nLine 4\nLine 5\nLine 6\nLine 7\nLine 8\nLine 9\nLine 10\n"
}
